(140: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%23%20Context%0A%0ACross-link%20to%20%5Blink-foundation%2Fjs-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template%2362%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fjs-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template%2Fissues%2F62%29%20which%20is%20the%20primary%20host%20for%20the%20pattern.%0A%0A%60konard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%60%20recently%20shipped%20%5BPR%20%2352%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fkonard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2Fpull%2F52%29%20%28closes%20%5Bissue%20%2351%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fkonard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2Fissues%2F51%29%29%20which%20adds%20a%20release-time%20pipeline%20that%20auto-regenerates%20every%20preview%20image%20%28README%20%2B%20Pages%20site%20%2B%20%60og%3Aimage%60%29%20using%20%5B%60browser-commander%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fwww.npmjs.com%2Fpackage%2Fbrowser-commander%29%20%2B%20Playwright%2C%20then%20commits%20the%20drift%20back%20to%20%60main%60.%0A%0AWhile%20auditing%20CI%20parity%20I%20checked%20the%20four%20%60link-foundation%60%20AI-driven-development-pipeline-template%20repos%20and%20%2A%2Anone%2A%2A%20ship%20browser%20automation%20or%20screenshot%20tooling.%20Full%20per-template%20survey%3A%20%5B%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-51%2Fdata%2Ftemplates%2Fsurvey.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fkonard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2Fblob%2Fissue-51-60ec0489f01f%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-51%2Fdata%2Ftemplates%2Fsurvey.md%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Relevance%20to%20this%20template%0A%0AThere%20is%20no%20example-app%20surface%20here%20today%3B%20this%20is%20a%20%2A%2Atracking%20issue%2A%2A%20so%20the%20pattern%20is%20registered%20if%2Fwhen%20one%20is%20added.%20The%20Rust-script-based%20%60scripts%2F%60%20ecosystem%20could%20shell%20out%20to%20a%20Node-only%20screenshot%20script%20identical%20to%20the%20JS%20one%2C%20since%20the%20screenshot%20job%20doesn%27t%20need%20to%20be%20Rust-native.%0A%0A%23%23%20Suggested%20action%0A%0A1.%20Track%20this%20issue%20as%20a%20placeholder.%0A2.%20When%20an%20example-app%20surface%20lands%20here%2C%20mirror%20the%20recipe%20from%20the%20primary%20upstream%20issue.%0A%0A%23%23%20Related%0A%0A-%20konard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2351%0A-%20konard%2Fvk-bot-desktop%2352%0A-%20link-foundation%2Fjs-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template%2362%20%E2%80%94%20primary%20upstream%20issue%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
